    "Stem": "At Flash Capital, the board's risk committee asks how COSO ERM 2017's Performance component differs from Review and Revision. Risk officer Maya Caldwell explains that Performance focuses on identifying, assessing, and responding to risk. Which activity is the clearest example of the Performance component in action?",
