    "UniqueConceptKey": "D-250-risk-response-avoid-exit-decision",
    "Stem": "Flash Industrial operates a specialty chemicals plant. A proposed product line requires a solvent now linked to lawsuits in three countries. Even with redesigned handling and warnings, the board concludes the liability exposure exceeds the company's risk appetite and the projected margin cannot justify it. Management decides not to launch the product. Under COSO ERM 2017, which risk response is this?",
