    "ExplanationWrongC": "",
    "ExplanationWrongD": "Option D is wrong because Accept retains the risk without further action, typically when the residual exposure sits within appetite or the cost of response exceeds the benefit. Accepting would mean launching despite the liability; management instead chose not to engage in the activity at all.",
