    "UniqueConceptKey": "D-251-kri-leading-lagging-portfolio",
    "Stem": "Flash Logistics monitors fleet safety. Risk analyst Priya Ramaswamy evaluates four indicators: (1) average driver hours per week, (2) number of accidents last quarter, (3) percentage of trucks with overdue maintenance, (4) dollar value of claims paid last year. Which pair best supports LEADING insight into future accident risk?",
