    "UniqueConceptKey": "D-265-risk-culture-tone-at-top",
    "Stem": "Flash Manufacturing's board reviews a proposed acquisition that would double the company's debt. The CRO warns that the debt-to-EBITDA ratio would rise from 2.0x to 5.5x and downgrade probability from 10% to 45%. The CEO dismisses the analysis and tells the CRO to 'support the growth vision.' Under COSO ERM 2017, which cultural deficiency is most evident?",
