    "ExplanationCorrect": "Under COSO ERM 2017, a healthy risk culture enables open challenge and the escalation of risk information without fear of reprisal. Here the CEO dismissed a material risk analysis and instructed the CRO to 'support the growth vision,' which suppresses dissenting information and prevents the board from seeing the full risk picture. Option B identifies this deficiency — the inability to challenge strategy openly. It is not over-communication, not model dependence, and not excessive conservatism.",
