    "Stem": "Flash Manufacturing's ERM team assesses a supplier-quality risk. The inherent likelihood is 50% and the inherent impact is $3,000,000. After controls, the residual likelihood is 20% and the residual impact is $1,500,000. Risk analyst Priya Ramaswamy reports the assessment. Which statement correctly distinguishes the inherent from the residual risk?",
